WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Unity-Simulink co-simulation of a renewable-powered AEM electrolyser.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Solar and wind generation are integrated with the DC bus.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Simulated electrical and process signals describe electrolyser operation.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Electrolyte circulation and cooling are shown with process signals.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Hydrogen and oxygen storage vessels with pressure and flow signals.
